{"id":142205073,"slug":"an-open-letter-to-ehr-company-luminello","title":"An Open Letter to EHR Company \"Luminello,\" Regarding Selling Out to the Man.","subtitle":"In the style of The Pixies classic, \"Where is My Mind\"","post_date":"2024-03-01T15:22:55.944Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/an-open-letter-to-ehr-company-luminello","wordcount":688,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:54:14.234Z","body_sha256":"4164cf2d64e53d18dcd86f60f33c2a65f8c20da1bae95f1c0b7e2a4da74e594b","text_words":700,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p><strong>The Frontier Psychiatrists</strong> is an <em>indie</em> daily newsletter.   I <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/my-precious-specialty-psychiatry?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">wrote an article</a> a couple of days ago about Luminello, an electronic health record company that was acquired by Simple Practice. I don't use Luminello anymore, but I did.  I need the medical records from Luminello to come back to me because, you know, <em>doctor stuff</em>.  In summary, I <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/its-a-scam-how-private-equity-convinced\">pointed out it is part of a private equity roll-up. </a> I requested my medical records exported, over a week ago. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>It's been a <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/change-healthcarein-what-direction?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">bad week for healthcare privacy concerns</a>, and a bad week for health technology exploits, <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/change-healthcare-is-a-big-enough?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">given the change healthcare debacle</a>.  I don't need to worry about this as well.</p><p>I grew up in the 90s   Back then, selling out to the majors wasn't cool.  Then technology destroyed the music industry, so it didn't matter anymore.   I feel the same way about <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/private-equity-acquisition-of-vampires\">health selling out private equity.</a>  Steve Albini is my favorite recording engineer, he wouldn't put up with his nonsense either.  What about artistic vision?  One of the things I find particularly off-putting is when private equity roll-up touts “the founders,” as if they still have anything to do with the decision-making for the medical practice…or a clinician-founded technology company.   This is like Sony taking credit for Modest Mouse.  <em>NO!  THEY WERE ON SUB-POP!</em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg\" width=\"562\" height=\"544.137984496124\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1249,&quot;width&quot;:1290,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:562,&quot;bytes&quot;:275525,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y1tH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ff2d763-7192-4ebb-9df9-0d4488cac2d8_1290x1249.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Kim Deal from the Pixies.</figcaption></figure></div><p>Look, <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/vampires-a-private-equity-cautionary-1bd\">I tried to sell out to vampires, too.</a>  </p><p>I tried to export my charts. I tried to do it a week ago. I clicked export, and still, nothing has happened. And yet today, I got an email pestering me to switch over to the company that bought them, that can't prescribe medicines.  Given the change healthcare debacle, I'm not sure anybody can reliably prescribe medicines, but still.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg\" width=\"430\" height=\"763.806907378336\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/af79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:2263,&quot;width&quot;:1274,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:430,&quot;bytes&quot;:326400,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2g34!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf79c0c0-14f4-4b2e-a0b6-d4782a8b9fd5_1274x2263.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>If I don't move fast enough, I lose access to my charts. Nothing I can do if they don't move fast enough to give me my charts.  Other than make fun of them, and talk about rock 'n' roll, which is exactly what I'm doing.</p><p>It turns out that their website even encourages me to get my data out, and reminds me how important it is to check that it's there. I'm going to remind them the same thing. It's important. Here, it's even step four on your website:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OBt9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F52015cae-b245-48c1-8d80-65fd2f9c6921_1290x1894.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OBt9!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_a