line><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I'd like to confirm all data as present, but your lack of data export is making Kim Deal —<em>so sad</em>.  Look at how upset it's making Black Francis?</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg\" width=\"432\" height=\"631.9255813953488\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1887,&quot;width&quot;:1290,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:432,&quot;bytes&quot;:368492,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4oZi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e787dd7-a539-4349-9407-e473a30034f3_1290x1887.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Black Francis has feelings.</figcaption></figure></div><p>How big is this problem? It's <strong>gigantic</strong>. Yes. There are other songs I can parody after this if I'm still upset!</p><p>To amuse myself, I'm gonna write my letter to Simple Practice and Luminello in the form of a parody of the song “Where is My Mind” by The Pixies.</p><div class=\"pullquote\"><p>Ooh, stop</p><p>With your charts is the ether and your data in the cloud<br>Try this request and consider it, yeah (yeah)<br>Your valuation will collapse, and there's nothing in it<br>And you'll ask yourself</p><p>Where are my charts?<br>Where are my charts?<br>Where are Owen’s charts?<br>Way out of compliance, need enforcement</p><p>I was requesting my medical records<br>liability was lurking behind the request<br>Except for the BAA<br>Was noted by me, I swear I was trying to warn you in good faith</p><p>Where are my charts?<br>Where are my charts?<br>Where are Owen’s charts?<br>Way out of compliance, need enforcement</p><p>With your ass on the line and your priorities unsound<br>Try this request and consider it, yeah<br>Your stock will collapse, and Regulators will fill your day<br>And you'll ask yourself</p><p>What did you know?<br>When did you know it?<br>Where are my charts?<br>Way out of compliance— could be a class action!</p><p>With your ass on the line, and your IT unsound <br>Try this request and fulfill it, yeah</p></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ytq9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F656107eb-69eb-459a-a110-ad57caa4f630_5712x4284.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ytq9!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F656107eb-69eb-459a-a110-ad57caa4f630_5712x4284.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ytq9!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F656107eb-69eb-459a-a110-ad57caa4f630_5712x4284.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ytq9!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F656107eb-69eb-459a-a110-ad57caa4f630_5712x4284.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ytq9!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F656107eb-69eb-459a-a110-ad57caa4f630_5712x4284.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ytq9!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_pr